  (text
    "Host header J801 (2x5 2.54mm) to FRDM-IMX95 3.3V I2C (VERIFY host header voltage is 3.3V; bus also hosts USB5744 SMBus and PCA9306->PI7C).\nU801 TCA6416A @0x20 (ADDR=GND): outputs - per-slot PWR_EN, FCPO#, RESET (active-high to NFET), WDIS (active-high to NFET), PCIE_EN; HUB_RESET_N.\nU802 TCA6416A @0x21 (ADDR=VCCP): inputs - slot PG, slot WAKE#, rail PGs; outputs - 2 user LEDs, SLOT1-3_PCIE_SEL (M.2 pin 20, rev 0.3). P17 spare (test pad).\nAll TCA6416A pins are inputs after POR -> board pull-ups/pull-downs define safe defaults (slots OFF, modules held in FCPO#).\nOther I2C addresses: USB5744 SMBus (default 0x2D, VERIFY), PI7C switch 0x6F (via PCA9306). HD3SS3220 I2C disabled (GPIO mode).\nBus pull-ups: 10k on hub sheet (strap); 4.7k here DNP (host board normally provides).\nPG LEDs: 2N7002 driven from each open-drain PG net (LED on = rail good)."
    (exclude_from_sim no)
    (at 254 17.78 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top))
    (uuid "efe97598-0740-564a-8c79-3674483fb51e"))
